      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We build barbed wire, pipe, and game fence on the ag land around McGregor, from the US 84 corridor out to the Coryell County line. Free written estimates and a 24/7 line for cattle-out emergencies.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
