<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you own land around McGregor, you already know this corner of McLennan County is changing fast. The SpaceX test facility south of town has brought jobs, traffic, and a wave of land buyers who want their places fenced right. Whether you run cows on a section of blackland or you just bought 30 acres off US 84, Brazos Ridge Fence Co. builds fence that holds up to this ground and this weather.</p><p>We're a Waco-based crew that works southwest McLennan County every week. We know where the rock starts, where the clay swells, and where the Middle Bosque bottoms will test a water gap every spring. Call (509) 351-8404 for a free written estimate, or start with our <a href="/ranch-fence-cost/">ranch fence cost guide</a> if you're still penciling out the numbers.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in McGregor</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for McGregor Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Barbed Wire Fence</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Five and six strand <a href="/barbed-wire-fence-waco/">barbed wire fence</a> for cattle country between McGregor, Moody, and Oglesby. Steel t-posts, pipe corners, and wire stretched tight enough to turn a bull.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Pipe Fence</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Welded <a href="/pipe-fence-waco/">pipe fence</a>, corrals, and working pens built to last decades on McGregor ag land. Popular with new landowners along US 84 who want a fence they'll never rebuild.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">High Game Fence</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Eight-foot <a href="/game-fence-installation-waco/">game fence</a> for whitetail and exotic operations in the broken country west of McGregor toward the Coryell line. We handle the rock drilling that terrain demands.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Ranch Entrance Gates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Custom <a href="/ranch-entrance-gates-waco/">ranch entrance gates</a> with pipe frames, stone columns, and automatic openers. A lot of McGregor buyers want the entrance done first, and we get it.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
